"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-11-14T23:03:01Z","updated_at":"2025-11-15T13:15:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.6.dev4.official [bd2ca13c6] to v4.5.stable.official [876b29033], probably earlier versions too\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev4 - Ubuntu 25.04 25.04 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (nvidia; 580.95.05) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13600K (20 threads) - 30.60 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen the Dock Tab Style is set to _Icon Only_ and the _Main Font Size_ is higher than the default value, the height of the tab bars is no longer consistent.\nThis issue comes up with both the _Modern_ and _Classic_ theme and is independent of _Base Spacing_ and _Additional Spacing_ settings.\nIt seems that the dock tab container height should scale with the _Main Font Size_ setting even if there is only an icon to fix this issue.\n\nText Only\n<img width=\"604\" height=\"166\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9e7b4314-ccc8-486b-9483-99e880dd6bd9\" />\nIcon Only\n<img width=\"604\" height=\"166\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d3c6c592-f5e4-43e2-9455-517dcefbbf4a\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUnder _Editor Settings_, set\n * _Interface_ > _Editor_ > _Dock Tab Style_ to _Icon Only_\n * _Interface_ > _Editor_ > _Main Font Size_ to a higher than default value\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112789/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112789/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}